,{},".",[312,334,335,336,339],{},"Every tooltip in the library uses it: ",[316,337,338],{},"ShuoInfoTooltip"," and the truncated-text tooltips of the select menu, date picker, file input, checkbox and option groups all show on long press on phones too.",[341,342,344],"h2",{"id":343},"usage","Usage",[346,347,349],"h3",{"id":348},"tooltip-text","Tooltip text",[312,351,352,355,356,359,360,359,363,366,367,370],{},[316,353,354],{},"text"," is the tooltip content, and the trigger goes in the default slot. Props such as ",[316,357,358],{},"kbds",", ",[316,361,362],{},"content",[316,364,365],{},"arrow"," and ",[316,368,369],{},"delayDuration"," are the same as Nuxt UI.",[372,373],"component-example",{"name":348},[346,375,377],{"id":376},"touch-long-press","Touch long press",[312,379,380],{},"On touch devices, holding the trigger for about 0.5 seconds shows the tooltip, which stays open after you lift your finger and closes when you tap elsewhere or scroll the page.",[382,383,384,388,391,394],"ul",{},[385,386,387],"li",{},"When a long press shows the tooltip, lifting your finger does not trigger the trigger's own action (click, check, open a menu and so on).",[385,389,390],{},"A normal tap triggers the original action as usual without showing the tooltip; focus caused by a tap does not show it either.",[385,392,393],{},"Moving your finger after pressing counts as scrolling and does not show the tooltip.",[385,395,396],{},"During a long press, the browser's long-press menu is not shown and text inside the trigger is not selected (except in inputs).",[312,398,399,400,403,404,407],{},"With ",[316,401,402],{},"touch"," set to ",[316,405,406],{},"false",", it behaves like the original Nuxt UI tooltip and touch cannot open it.",[372,409],{"name":410},"tooltip-touch",[312,412,413,414,417,418,332],{},"To turn it off site-wide, set ",[316,415,416],{},"components.tooltip.touch: false","; the tooltips inside the library turn off too. See ",[419,420,42],"a",{"href":421},"\u002Fgetting-started\u002Ftheme\u002Fcomponent-defaults",[346,423,425],{"id":424},"open-state","Open state",[312,427,428,429,432,433,332],{},"Bind the open state with ",[316,430,431],{},"v-model:open"," to open or close it from code; without binding, set the initial state with ",[316,434,435],{},"default-open",[372,437],{"name":438},"tooltip-open",[341,440,442],{"id":441},"props","Props",[444,445],"component-props",{"name":322},[341,447,449],{"id":448},"slots","Slots",[451,452,453,466],"table",{},[454,455,456],"thead",{},[457,458,459,463],"tr",{},[460,461,462],"th",{},"Slot",[460,464,465],{},"Description",[467,468,469,480],"tbody",{},[457,470,471,477],{},[472,473,474],"td",{},[316,475,476],{},"default",[472,478,479],{},"The trigger",[457,481,482,486],{},[472,483,484],{},[316,485,362],{},[472,487,488,489],{},"Custom tooltip content, like Nuxt UI's ",[316,490,362],{},[341,492,494],{"id":493},"changelog","Changelog",[496,497],"component-changelog",{"name":322},{"title":499,"searchDepth":500,"depth":500,"links":501},"",2,[502,508,509,510],{"id":343,"depth":500,"text":344,"children":503},[504,506,507],{"id":348,"depth":505,"text":349},3,{"id":376,"depth":505,"text":377},{"id":424,"depth":505,"text":425},{"id":441,"depth":500,"text":442},{"id":448,"depth":500,"text":449},{"id":493,"depth":500,"text":494},"Tooltip built on UTooltip that adds long press on touch devices.","md",[514],{"label":318,"icon":515,"to":516,"target":517},"i-simple-icons-nuxtdotjs","https:\u002F\u002Fui.nuxt.com\u002Fdocs\u002Fcomponents\u002Ftooltip","_blank",{},{"title":217,"icon":220},{"title":217,"description":511},"4565oldi4mLlQ23DDtLB3PNuatpzumlaK2Y6aSQ2HM4",[523,525],{"title":212,"path":213,"stem":214,"description":524,"icon":215,"children":-1},"Info icon with a tooltip, shown on hover, keyboard focus or long press on touch devices.",{"title":62,"path":232,"stem":233,"description":526,"icon":65,"children":-1},"Shared validation rules for Valibot, with consistent error messages across the site.",179550919892